{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ef70ff8a-9bae-8298-8da0-0d897145ea85",
  "created_at": "2025-12-12T13:18:02-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Yesenia Castillo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T13:10:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T13:10:48-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes. My name is Yesenia Castillo. I am calling about a drain. In the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T13:11:02-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a storm drain. Sure. Take your time. Where's the drain, what's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T13:11:15-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two hundred ninety-one Ocean Avenue. The Ocean Drive side. The drain is in front of the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T13:11:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 291 Ocean Avenue. And what's it doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T13:11:38-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is slow. It makes a noise, like grunting. Then the water comes up on the street. It does not go down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T13:11:57-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so it's gurgling and backing up. Was that during a storm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T13:12:08-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. No storm. It is dry now. No rain this week. But when the snow melts, the ice goes away, it backs up. Every time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T13:12:29-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So a thaw does it. Writing that down: backs up on thaw, no storm, slow draining. How long has it been going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T13:12:49-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since I live here. Some months. My neighbor tells me it happens every big rain. Always. She says many years."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T13:13:06-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that tracks with what you're describing. Is the water getting onto the property or just pooling in the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T13:13:23-05:00",
      "duration": 28,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The street, and it comes to the edge of the driveway. I am worried it goes to the house. I am frustrated. It is the same problem again and again, and nobody fixes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T13:13:51-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Let me get this logged so a crew can look at it. Is it the only drain on that stretch, or are there others nearby that are also slow?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T13:14:18-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think only this one. Others, I do not see. [pause] Excuse me. I ask a question. Is this a city drain or a state one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T13:14:40-05:00",
      "duration": 39,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Ocean Avenue is a busy road, so some of the drains along it could be state. I'll have the crew check whose it is when they go out. If it's the state's, we'll pass it along to them so you don't have to chase it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T13:15:19-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That is good. You pass it. I do not call two places."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T13:15:31-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, you've called the right place. We'll sort out which one. Do you want me to put a phone number on the work order in case they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T13:15:57-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is four zero one, five five five, zero one nine one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T13:16:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-one. And is it Yesenia, Y-E-S-E-N-I-A, Castillo?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T13:16:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Correct. Castillo, with two L."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T13:16:23-05:00",
      "duration": 32,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. So I've got Castillo, 291 Ocean Avenue, drain in front of the house slow and backing up on thaws, dry weather, neighbors say it's long-standing. Anything else, like a smell or a sinkhole or the pavement dipping?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T13:16:55-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No smell. The street is okay. Only the water. Excuse me, I have a long drive today. I need to go soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T13:17:14-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, we're basically done. Someone from our crew should get out to look at it in the next week or so, and if it's state, we'll hand it off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T13:17:40-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Next week. Okay. Thank you. I hope it is real this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T13:17:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's logged, I promise. Drive safe, Yesenia."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T13:17:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Bye."
    }
  ],
